<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">今日一句</view>
    <view class="sentence">{{sentence.en}}</view>
    <view class="muted translation">{{sentence.zh}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card actions">
    <view class="title small">在电脑或网页上登录单词之舞</view>
    <view class="muted">网页上点「微信登录」会出现一个小程序码：用微信「扫一扫」扫它，确认后网页就登录了。没法扫码时，输入网页上的 6 位配对码。</view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="goPair">输入配对码</button>
  </view>
</view>
